title: Opium Policy
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
on-arrival: opium_timer += 9; month_actions += 1
view-if: opium_timer <= 0
card-image: img/kmtopium.jpg

= Opium Policy

Opium poppies have terrorized China since the British came knocking on the Manchu government. Now, it is still widespread with warlords and underground smugglers keeping the illegal product going.

- @beat: Crack down on Opium production.
- @yun: Block imports from Tang Jiyao in Yunnan.
- @produce: Start producing our own product.
- @produce2: Keep producing more product.
- @no: Leave the Opium trade alone for now.
- @easy_discard

@beat
subtitle: -1 funds
choose-if: funds >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough funds.
on-arrival: funds -= 1; rural_kmt -= 5; workers_kmt += 5; old_middle_kmt += 5; new_middle_kmt += 5;

We have begun cracking down on Opium farms. The farmers are angry about this but the people in the city like this.

@yun
subtitle: Tang Jiyao won't like this.
view-if: yunnan_governor = "Tang Jiyao"
on-arrival: yun_relation -= 10; workers_kmt += 5; old_middle_kmt += 5; new_middle_kmt += 5;
face-image: img/portraits/TangJiyao.jpg

Tang Jiyao is heavily involved in the production of Opium. Cutting his profits pisses him off.

@produce
subtitle: +2 funds every quarter - no one will like this.
view-if: opium_producing = 0
on-arrival: income += 2; opium_producing += 1; rural_kmt -= 2; workers_kmt -= 8; old_middle_kmt -= 8; new_middle_kmt -= 8; gxc_relation -= 10; gui_relation -= 10; cpc_relation -= 5;

We have begun producing our own poppies in Guangdong. This looks very dangerous for us and the other warlords.

@produce2
subtitle: +3 funds every quarter - no one will like this.
view-if: opium_producing >= 1
on-arrival: income += 3; opium_producing += 1; rural_kmt -= 5; workers_kmt -= 15; old_middle_kmt -= 15; new_middle_kmt -= 15; gxc_relation -= 10; gui_relation -= 10; cpc_relation -= 5; nra_militancy -= 0.1;

@no
go-to: root

We keep producing more opium in Guangdong. Everyone hates us for this. Even our soldiers are getting addicted.

